Monetization/Drop Strategy Notes:

┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Teasers / Previews            │
│ (Spotify, YouTube, Apple)     │
│ - 30–60 sec snippets          │
│ - Build hype & drive traffic  │
│ - Include UTM / referral links│
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Premium Early Streaming       │
│ (Your Platform)               │
│ - Full songs/albums           │
│ - Streaming-only, no downloads│
│ - Early access for superfans  │
│ - Optional NFTs, merch bundles│
│ - Limited time window         │
│ - Single-login enforcement    │
│ - Watermark / fingerprinting  │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Public Release                │
│ (Spotify, YouTube, Apple)     │
│ - Standard release            │
│ - Streams = royalties         │
│ - Exposure & traffic          │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Analytics & Fan Tracking      │
│ - Plays, skips, time spent    │
│ - Conversion: teaser → early  │
│ - Engagement metrics          │
│ - Identify superfans          │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Monetization Loop             │
│ - Subscriptions for early access│
│ - NFTs / merch / exclusive perks│
│ - Limited edition campaigns   │
│ - Optimize future drops       │
└───────────────────────────────┘




Splits: 

┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Artist Website & Monetization │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Song / Beat Types             │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Owned Beats / Original Songs│
│   - Full monetization on site │
│   - Early access, VIP, NFTs   │
│ • Leased Beats / Collaborations│
│   - Public platforms only     │
│   - Free teasers (15–30 sec) │
│   - Attribution required      │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Platform Distribution          │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • YouTube / Spotify / Apple   │
│   - Full songs for exposure   │
│   - Leased beats revenue split│
│ • Your Website                │
│   - Owned beats only          │
│   - Monetized subscriptions   │
│   - Early access & VIP content│
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Monetization Flow             │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ 1. Platform pays $100         │
│ 2. Distributor (CD Baby) 9%  │
│    → $9 fee                   │
│ 3. Remaining $91 split 50/50  │
│    - Producer (leased beat):  │
│      $45.50                   │
│    - You: $45.50 (owned beat)│
│ • Owned beats: you keep all remaining after fees │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Teasers & Previews            │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Leased beats: 15–30 sec clips│
│ • Free, streaming-only         │
│ • Attribution to producer      │
│ • Drives traffic to platform   │
│ • Do NOT monetize leased beats │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Release Strategy              │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ Phase 0 – Prep                │
│   - Artist branding, logos    │
│   - Platform & website setup  │
│   - Plan release schedule     │
│ Phase 1 – Public Release      │
│   - Full songs on YouTube / Spotify / Apple Music │
│ Phase 2 – Early Access        │
│   - Owned beats on website   │
│   - Subscriptions, VIP, NFTs │
│ Phase 3 – Ongoing             │
│   - Analytics & optimization │
│   - Build fanbase & email list│
│   - Future releases & premium content │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Best Practices                │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Always honor lease splits   │
│ • Give attribution for leased beats │
│ • Use short teasers for hype  │
│ • Monetize only owned beats   │
│ • Track analytics via UTM / Convex │
│ • Build relationships with producers │
└───────────────────────────────┘





