(TLDR)


┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Artist Platform Strategy TL;DR│
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Song / Beat Types             │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Owned Beats → monetize fully│
│   (subscriptions, VIP, NFTs) │
│ • Leased Beats → public platforms only │
│   Free teasers on website     │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Monetization & Revenue Splits │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Distributor fee first (e.g., CD Baby 9%) │
│ • Remaining revenue: split with producer if leased (e.g., 50/50) │
│ • Owned beats: you keep all after fees   │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Teasers & Promotion           │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Short 15–30 sec clips of leased beats│
│ • Free streaming only, attribution required │
│ • Drives traffic to website / email list │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Release Strategy              │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ Phase 0 – Prep: branding, platforms, assets │
│ Phase 1 – Public Release: full songs on YouTube / Spotify / Apple Music │
│ Phase 2 – Early Access: website w/ owned beats, subscriptions, VIP content │
│ Phase 3 – Ongoing: analyze analytics, optimize releases, build audience │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘

              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Best Practices                │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Honor lease agreements      │
│ • Monetize only what you own  │
│ • Track analytics (UTM / Convex) │
│ • Maintain good producer relationships │
└───────────────────────────────┘





Methods:

┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Public Platforms (Exposure)   │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • YouTube (full tracks, ads) │
│ • SoundCloud (full tracks, streaming analytics) │
│ • Spotify (full tracks, royalties, charts) │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Website Hub / “Premium Player”│
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Embed YouTube / SoundCloud │
│ • Fans stream directly → analytics tracked (Convex/UTM) │
│ • Owned beats & exclusive content available │
│ • VIP content, early access, subscriptions, merch, NFTs │
│ • Funnels casual listeners → superfans │
└─────────────┬─────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Monetization & Fan Conversion │
├───────────────────────────────┤
│ • Owned beats = full revenue on site │
│ • Leased beats = public platforms only │
│ • Subscriptions / VIP tiers / NFTs / merch │
│ • Email / wallet capture → long-term fanbase │
└───────────────────────────────┘
